Needs MCPE_TEST_ARCH=aarch64, MCPE_TEST_COMPOSITOR=none and
MCPE_TEST_FB_MODE=720x480, because uname, a compositor and fbset are live.

--- The one field this capture cannot reproduce ---

MCPE_HAS_PIPEWIRE is 0 here and 1 on the device. Knulli runs PipeWire but
exposes no socket at any path the probe checks, so the device detects it purely
through `pidof pipewire` -- a running daemon, which no capture can hold. The
resolved backend is `pulse` either way, which is what actually drives the launch;
only the informational flag differs.
